# Experiment outputs are reproducible from `offcriterion run`; keep the
# publication tables in version control and leave the bulk data untracked.
*.csv
*.json
!.gitignore
# Feasibility and power-planning tables are part of the preregistration
# record: small, frozen, and tracked.
!persuade_feasibility/*.csv
!persuade_feasibility/*.json
# Dry-run outputs are disposable pipeline-validation artifacts.
dryrun/
# Post-hoc robustness artifacts are part of the frozen post-hoc record.
!posthoc/*.csv
!posthoc/*.json
!posthoc/*.md
